<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Catherine Waweru — Data Analyst</title>
<meta name="description" content="Catherine Waweru — Data Analyst specializing in SQL, BigQuery, and Tableau. Nairobi, Kenya.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#101922;
    --paper:#EEF1EF;
    --panel:#FFFFFF;
    --accent:#1F9D6B;
    --accent-amber:#E8A33D;
    --muted:#5B6670;
    --line:#D7DCD9;
    --maxw:1040px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    margin:0;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px;}
  .kicker{
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  nav{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(238,241,239,0.88);
    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav .wrap{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    height:64px;
  }
  .nav-name{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:16px;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; font-size:14px; color:var(--muted);}
  .nav-links a{text-decoration:none; transition:color .15s; padding-left:28px;}
  .nav-links a:first-child{padding-left:0;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  header.hero{padding:88px 0 72px;}
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px);
    line-height:1.14;
    margin:14px 0 22px;
  }
  .hero p.sub{
    font-size:18px;
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:46ch;
    margin:0 0 30px;
  }
  .cta-row{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center;
    padding:12px 22px;
    border-radius:3px;
    font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500;
    text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid var(--ink);
    transition:transform .15s ease, background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .btn-solid{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}
  .btn-solid:hover{transform:translateY(-1px); background:#000;}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent; color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}

  .trace-panel{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:22px 22px 18px;
  }
  .trace-label{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:10px;}
  svg#traceline{width:100%; height:auto; display:block;}
  .trace-path{
    fill:none; stroke:var(--accent); stroke-width:2.4;
    stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round;
    stroke-dasharray:600; stroke-dashoffset:600;
    animation:draw 2.1s ease forwards .3s;
  }
  .trace-path-noisy{
    fill:none; stroke:var(--muted); stroke-width:1.6;
    stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round;
    opacity:.55;
    stroke-dasharray:420; stroke-dashoffset:420;
    animation:draw 1.6s ease forwards .1s;
  }
  @keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}
  .trace-caption{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between;
    font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:6px;
  }

  /* ---------- SECTION SHELL ---------- */
  section{padding:64px 0;}
  section + section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .section-head{margin-bottom:36px;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:26px;}

  /* ---------- JOURNEY ---------- */
  .timeline{position:relative; padding-left:2px;}
  .tl-item{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;
    gap:20px;
    position:relative;
    padding-bottom:34px;
  }
  .tl-item:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}
  .tl-num{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
    font-size:14px; font-weight:600;
    color:var(--accent);
    position:relative;
  }
  .tl-item:not(:last-child) .tl-num::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:26px; left:9px;
    width:1px; height:calc(100% + 8px);
    background:var(--line);
  }
  .tl-body h3{font-size:17px; margin-bottom:2px;}
  .tl-role{font-size:14.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:8px;}
  .tl-desc{font-size:15px; color:#374049; max-width:60ch;}

  /* ---------- SKILLS ---------- */
  .skills-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:28px 48px;
  }
  .skill-group h3{
    font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600;
    color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .skill-group p{font-size:14.5px; color:var(--muted); margin:0;}

  /* ---------- PROJECTS ---------- */
  .project{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;
    gap:36px;
    padding:30px 0;
    align-items:start;
  }
  .project + .project{border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .project-viz{width:100%; height:auto;}
  .project-tags{display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .tag{
    font-size:12px; color:var(--ink);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:3px 9px;
    border-radius:2px;
  }
  .project h3{font-size:19px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .project p{font-size:15px; color:#374049; max-width:62ch; margin:0 0 10px;}
  .project a.plink{
    font-size:14px; font-weight:500;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom:1px;
  }

  /* ---------- CONTACT ---------- */
  .contact-row{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end;
    flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px;
  }
  .contact-row h2{font-size:28px; max-width:14ch;}
  .contact-links{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; font-size:15px;}
  .contact-links a{text-decoration:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:2px; width:fit-content;}
  .contact-links a:hover{border-color:var(--ink);}

  footer{padding:26px 0 40px; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted);}

  @media (max-width:760px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .project{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .skills-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .nav-links{display:none;}
  }
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-name">Catherine Waweru</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#journey">Journey</a>
      <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">Nairobi, Kenya — Data Analyst</div>
      <h1>I spent five years under the hood of electric buses. Now I dig through their data instead.</h1>
      <p class="sub">SQL, BigQuery, and Tableau — turning fleet and operational data into decisions, with a technician's eye for what the numbers are actually describing.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#projects">See the work</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:kathyweru85@gmail.com">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="trace-panel">
      <div class="trace-label">Two years of readings, cleaned up</div>
      <svg id="traceline" viewBox="0 0 320 140" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <polyline class="trace-path-noisy" points="0,95 24,80 38,102 55,70 72,90 90,60 108,88 126,55 145,78 160,50" />
        <polyline class="trace-path" points="160,50 180,58 200,40 220,44 240,22 260,28 280,12 300,16 320,4" />
      </svg>
      <div class="trace-caption">
        <span>technician era</span>
        <span>analyst era</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="journey">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Journey</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-num">01</div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <h3>Automotive Technician</h3>
          <div class="tl-role">BMW Center Kenya · Jul 2021 – Nov 2022</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Structured fault diagnosis on premium vehicles using OEM diagnostic software — the first habit of "trust the evidence, not the guess" that carried into every role after.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-num">02</div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <h3>Electric Bus Technician</h3>
          <div class="tl-role">BasiGo · Dec 2022 – Jan 2026</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Led installation of a 110kWh, 500V high-voltage battery system at 98% charge efficiency. BMS diagnostics, cell balancing, and predictive maintenance that cut breakdowns by 25%.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-num">03</div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <h3>Service Data Analyst</h3>
          <div class="tl-role">BasiGo · Feb 2026 – Jul 2026</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Moved into analytics. Built automated Python pipelines for fleet monitoring, ran EDA on high-volume fault logs, and shipped the dashboards that made failure trends visible.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="tl-num">04</div>
        <div class="tl-body">
          <h3>Operations Data Analyst</h3>
          <div class="tl-role">BasiGo · Aug 2026 – Present</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Cross-functional dashboards and KPI reporting spanning Manufacturing, Engineering, Customer Service, Supply Chain, and Quality. Currently deepening BigQuery and cloud-native analytics.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="skills">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Skills</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="skills-grid">
      <div class="skill-group">
        <h3>Data Analytics &amp; BI</h3>
        <p>SQL · Tableau · Python (Pandas, NumPy) · Exploratory Data Analysis · Data Validation &amp; Auditing</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-group">
        <h3>Data Engineering</h3>
        <p>BigQuery · ETL Pipelines · Data Automation (gspread, APIs) · Data Intake Standardization</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-group">
        <h3>Analytical Methods</h3>
        <p>Root Cause Analysis · KPI Auditing · Predictive Analytics · Statistical Modeling</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-group">
        <h3>Domain Depth</h3>
        <p>EV &amp; battery systems · High-voltage architecture (up to 500V) · Fleet telematics · OEM technical coordination</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Projects</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
      <svg class="project-viz" viewBox="0 0 200 110" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <line x1="0" y1="30" x2="200" y2="30" stroke="#D7DCD9" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
        <polyline points="0,50 20,45 40,25 55,95 70,98 90,80 110,65 130,55 150,40 170,15 190,8" fill="none" stroke="#1F9D6B" stroke-width="2.2"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">BigQuery</span><span class="tag">SQL</span><span class="tag">Tableau</span></div>
        <h3>JKIA Passenger Recovery Analysis</h3>
        <p>Full pipeline from a raw, messy public dataset through BigQuery — unpivoting, hierarchy validation, two independent audits — into a story-driven Tableau dashboard tracking Kenya's aviation recovery through COVID.</p>
        <a class="plink" href="#">View on Tableau Public →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
      <svg class="project-viz" viewBox="0 0 200 110" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect x="10" y="60" width="24" height="40" fill="#E8A33D"/>
        <rect x="45" y="40" width="24" height="60" fill="#1F9D6B"/>
        <rect x="80" y="70" width="24" height="30" fill="#E8A33D"/>
        <rect x="115" y="20" width="24" height="80" fill="#1F9D6B"/>
        <rect x="150" y="50" width="24" height="50" fill="#E8A33D"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">BigQuery</span><span class="tag">SQL</span><span class="tag">Sustainability</span></div>
        <h3>Kenya AI Carbon Audit</h3>
        <p>BigQuery pipeline modeling AI compute energy and emissions in Kenya against global tech hubs — the US, Ireland, Iceland — covering clean-baseline advantage, peaking-plant risk, and efficiency leverage.</p>
        <a class="plink" href="#">View on GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
      <svg class="project-viz" viewBox="0 0 200 110" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <polyline points="0,90 30,85 60,70 90,60 120,45 150,38 180,20 200,10" fill="none" stroke="#1F9D6B" stroke-width="2.2"/>
        <polyline points="0,95 30,92 60,88 90,82 120,75 150,68 180,58 200,52" fill="none" stroke="#5B6670" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".6"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Power BI</span><span class="tag">Time Series</span></div>
        <h3>Kenya Transport Emissions Dashboard</h3>
        <p>Interactive Power BI dashboard analyzing Kenya's transport-sector CO2, CH4, and N2O emissions from 1990–2022, with trend and year-over-year analysis built on Climate Watch / WRI data.</p>
        <a class="plink" href="#">View on GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
      <svg class="project-viz" viewBox="0 0 200 110" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect x="10" y="15" width="180" height="18" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#D7DCD9"/>
        <rect x="10" y="15" width="120" height="18" rx="2" fill="#1F9D6B" opacity=".85"/>
        <rect x="10" y="45" width="180" height="18" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#D7DCD9"/>
        <rect x="10" y="45" width="70" height="18" rx="2" fill="#E8A33D" opacity=".85"/>
        <rect x="10" y="75" width="180" height="18" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#D7DCD9"/>
        <rect x="10" y="75" width="155" height="18" rx="2" fill="#1F9D6B" opacity=".5"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Automation</span></div>
        <h3>Fleet Mileage Automation Pipeline</h3>
        <p>A scheduled pipeline that pulls mileage data from PostgreSQL weekly and produces clean, ready-to-use CSVs — removing a manual step that used to sit between raw telematics and reporting.</p>
        <a class="plink" href="#">View on GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
      <svg class="project-viz" viewBox="0 0 200 110" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="50" cy="55" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#D7DCD9" stroke-width="10"/>
        <circle cx="50" cy="55" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#1F9D6B" stroke-width="10" stroke-dasharray="140 214" stroke-linecap="round" transform="rotate(-90 50 55)"/>
        <circle cx="150" cy="55" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#D7DCD9" stroke-width="10"/>
        <circle cx="150" cy="55" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#E8A33D" stroke-width="10" stroke-dasharray="200 214" stroke-linecap="round" transform="rotate(-90 150 55)"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="tag">Performance</span></div>
        <h3>Window Function Query Optimization</h3>
        <p>Rebuilt slow telematics queries using PostgreSQL window functions in place of repeated self-joins, cutting query time meaningfully on high-volume mileage data.</p>
        <a class="plink" href="#">View on GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-row">
      <h2>Let's talk data.</h2>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:kathyweru85@gmail.com">kathyweru85@gmail.com</a>
        <a href="http://www.linkedin.com/in/waweru-c48b838220" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">Catherine Waweru — Nairobi, Kenya</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
